    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03756e12c182590885edd612",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……“NHK英里C”结束后，过了几天。\n我得知谷野美酒的精密检查没有问题，\n就在此时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd10dd21fae30350ed4bb02dc9db3cbabad9b32f901d79304ce9b49f4224c6e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
