    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dd9df1c75f4a5c7064feda3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“因为这个赛程还包含了皋月赏。\n我是真的一颗心悬在半空中，\n就怕她会受伤啊。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "566feca7cc994f59602930e2f438103069084363f4bbb8ee201c5f295150c5ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0a5ec5546359cd4485bf7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e63f64ae1904fcf07bab0ada331d13e164e5dd9cfb8cdad386ace12e23d08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecdfaecc333f362059b088b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（糟糕！照这样发展下去，\n我会被人潮吞没，无路可走……！！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fc72b1e02b79fce389215acbac5a545ac6b1d5b9da7ad1fc18d7b38445dc2ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edc635321e3b24b3e49d52f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主播",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41fab00b502315e18b62c8a7c2005b4a4d8106674dcc0e84f72853d5ffd7c64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce04e47ae6719c6ef07567ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“在社交平台上也有许多人表示\n自己很期待谷野美酒的活跃表现，\n同时也担心连续的激战对身体造成影响──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd399f037e9e55f1130e4796cade5eb33446410bc149dc27634e79bad1d3226",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8d80ff7aac517d23d902d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……至今仍有许多人\n对谷野美酒挑战“日本德比”的决定表示担忧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50e998e049fdb1c0aeffd55c0b03a5a76c1f417c24e7fbd95520c54f3859e65b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d741bc013ae78932fbabf0a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……如果是美酒，她会怎么想？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d37c0421f49bd5a3aeb1a27cdcd25ff618b7fba5e34248c704193a6a71c091c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08ecab9e3fa360a388631383",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其中也有人断言参加“NHK英里C”过于轻率，\n无法否认大家对她的看法相当严厉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09baef5d802c8ff9b34a2c9520f1307d73e0fd972ebfde84e85543b1153811b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c17258641f8f39b942cbc3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──她大概会用结果\n扭转所有逆风劣势吧。\n……当然，我也有一样的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be8e5ee005808f8e6513bcd4816df7d364da388c44dcac1a0b90b320f065589e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a83c0497c3f7718c49f62c23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是要是观众因为太担心自己\n而无法沉迷于自己的跑姿，\n这应该也会让她有些不开心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3fc457670b93d0bd13e517492abf0329853ea9218f6f370982cfa417b6ab4d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5100bc8aefb731cc44da8c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……现在能做的是──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "127a9803812e5f3cfa113f72cfaa43c82aa0564fe638028fd4be0aaa2b4cfe18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d718221a2e0f01eddebc87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么她也有可能\n为了吸引众人陷入酩酊\n而采取某些行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d247fe69e5d003c37534de1f11a3384bd246ce77f23894303a7bbd976af6d99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795d67b9bf3e91d80ce7f50d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e63f64ae1904fcf07bab0ada331d13e164e5dd9cfb8cdad386ace12e23d08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
