    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdcc77bd43e9d9a098e06e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "────哦？\n公开训练吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b17da25ffc62a37a5e480cc23112785820e959d033c5b7d7765542d3096ca07c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877a9d5f83b9e77d75e28508",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，训练项目必须在你可承受的范围内",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af707a2f9ac53dd2315608226662aaad053280a3e6827ba66183c0c05e3f6e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7bbc5786ef2a247ffdd4e99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我点点头表示肯定。刻意大张旗鼓地公开\n我们针对“日本德比”进行的训练，\n目的是宣传她没有半分衰退。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6abf1ead7f387e294a92289404cb90807e700996f40c876193c35b39b360ad5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fafb9b75f9a5eb186f81205",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在谷野美酒的第一优先是\n以德比为目标恢复状态，因此我想减少\n内容比较严苛的训练项目……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db3a014daabda6e6e7a43409a3dbc442e7ac269777e8723a32afa2e0479f24e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084307.json",
      "json_path": [
